WEBVTT

00:01:32.126 --> 00:01:36.495
The reason I jumped out the window

00:01:38.399 --> 00:01:43.268
Was because the deep blue sky
was so clear

00:01:44.738 --> 00:01:48.868
I was still uncertain about
the self I couldn't see

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:55.644
So I plunged out here, barefoot

00:01:56.817 --> 00:02:02.523
There are things I can't explain
or do well

00:02:02.523 --> 00:02:08.359
That lie beyond the mirror
that I stare at so intently

00:02:09.396 --> 00:02:14.902
So I put my rumpled-up dream
in my pocket

00:02:14.902 --> 00:02:22.009
And make a promise to myself
in the sky, ten years from now

00:02:22.009 --> 00:02:27.614
The future I've always believed in
is no mistake

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:33.954
Because I'm sure I have
stronger feelings than anyone else

00:02:33.954 --> 00:02:38.186
Tenderly

00:03:29.576 --> 00:03:34.536
