00:16:19.779 --> 00:16:20.643
Life
of
the
Party

00:22:23.242 --> 00:22:27.647
I can't lose heart,
but I'm not frantic either

00:22:27.647 --> 00:22:31.083
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:22:31.083 --> 00:22:36.055
With extraordinary effort
and a little miracle

00:22:36.055 --> 00:22:40.515
I get the feeling that it'll be
rosy and shining soon

00:22:42.395 --> 00:22:46.932
My life in Tokyo is so smooth,
don't I look chic?

00:22:46.932 --> 00:22:50.169
I even did research
on the most trendy clothes

00:22:50.169 --> 00:22:54.807
Now clubs recognize me
and just let me in

00:22:54.807 --> 00:22:58.878
My favorites are
my mini-skirts

00:22:58.878 --> 00:23:02.548
It's important to bond
with my friends

00:23:02.548 --> 00:23:06.419
So of course
I have a cell phone

00:23:06.419 --> 00:23:14.093
I got it by working hard at a job
that I can't talk about

00:23:14.093 --> 00:23:18.164
I can't lose heart,
but I'm not frantic either

00:23:18.164 --> 00:23:21.834
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:23:21.834 --> 00:23:24.003
I don't know what I want to do

00:23:24.003 --> 00:23:31.341
It seems these facts of loneliness
keep pouring down

00:23:33.679 --> 00:23:37.750
I don't know why I feel so sad,
I can't even cry

00:23:37.750 --> 00:23:41.420
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:23:41.420 --> 00:23:46.292
When I hear "How are you holding up"
in that familiar voice

00:23:46.292 --> 00:23:50.820
It feels like something's
tugging at my heartstrings

00:23:55.034 --> 00:24:20.025
Next Happy Lesson

00:24:20.025 --> 00:24:24.052
Next Happy Lesson
Restless *
